{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/testing/graph-insights","title":"Graph insights","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"graph-insights","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Graph insights"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The dependency graph behind the "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"architecture rules"}]},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"also measures what it models. Complexity, size and coupling are attached to the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"nodes a CraftTS developer reasons about — a route, a service, a primitive —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rather than to files, and they feed a report, metric thresholds and the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/ai/mcp-tools#graph-mcp-craft-ts-graph-mcp","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"graph MCP server"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Everything is computed statically and deterministically from the TypeScript"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"program. Nothing is sampled at runtime and nothing is guessed."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"metrics","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Metrics"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Each node carries a "},{"t":"code","text":"metrics"},{"t":"text","text":" field:"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Metric"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Meaning"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"cyclomaticOwn"}],[{"t":"code","text":"1 +"},{"t":"text","text":" the decision points of the node itself"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"cyclomaticTotal"}],[{"t":"code","text":"1 +"},{"t":"text","text":" the decision points of the node and of everything it "},{"t":"code","text":"contains"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"lines"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Lines of the declaration"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"fanIn"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Distinct nodes that depend on it ("},{"t":"code","text":"loads"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"renders"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"depends-on"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"calls"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"reads"},{"t":"text","text":"…)"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"fanOut"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Distinct nodes it depends on"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Decision points are "},{"t":"code","text":"if"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"?:"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"case"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"for"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"for…of"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"for…in"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"while"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"do"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"catch"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"&&"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"||"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"??"},{"t":"text","text":". Each one is credited to the "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"innermost"}]},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"node whose source contains it. A "},{"t":"code","text":"craftComputed"},{"t":"text","text":" declared inside a component"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"keeps its own branches; the component counts them only in its total. Nothing is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"counted twice."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"contains"},{"t":"text","text":" is structure, not coupling: a service owning a primitive does not"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"raise its fan-out."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"unknown-is-not-zero","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Unknown is not zero"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Some nodes have no source range of their own: an HTTP endpoint aggregates call"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"sites, a synthesised route check shares its alias, an Effect layer comes from a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"separate collector. Those nodes have "},{"t":"code","text":"fanIn"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"fanOut"},{"t":"text","text":" but no complexity and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"no line count — the fields are absent. The graph adds one"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_GRAPH_METRICS_UNKNOWN"},{"t":"text","text":" diagnostic per unmeasured kind, and every"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"consumer below leaves unknown values out instead of treating them as simple."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"hotspots","children":[{"t":"text","text":"God nodes and hotspots"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"God nodes"}]},{"t":"text","text":" are the nodes most depended upon: highest "},{"t":"code","text":"fanIn"},{"t":"text","text":" first."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Hotspots"}]},{"t":"text","text":" combine complexity, centrality and change:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"score = cyclomaticTotal × (1 + fanIn) × (1 + churn)"}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"churn"},{"t":"text","text":" is the number of commits touching the node's file since a date, read"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"from git. Without it, the score ranks complex central code. Template elements"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"are left out of the report rankings by default: an element's total includes"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"every element nested in it, so a single component's markup would fill the list."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { godNodes, graphHotspots } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/dev-tools/graph-metrics'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"graphHotspots","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph, { limit: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"5","kind":"number"},{"text":", kinds: [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'service'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"] });","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"report","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Report"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"graph","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"apps/shop/tsconfig.graph.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--root","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":".","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--out","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-dependency-graph","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--format","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"report","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--feature-glob","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'apps/shop/src/features/:feature/**'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--churn-since","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'3 months ago'","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"shell","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"--format report"},{"t":"text","text":" writes "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-dependency-graph.report.md"},{"t":"text","text":" and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-dependency-graph.report.json"},{"t":"text","text":"; "},{"t":"code","text":"--format all"},{"t":"text","text":" writes them next to the JSON"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"graph and the HTML explorer. The report contains:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"a summary: nodes and relations per kind, diagnostics per code;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"god nodes and hotspots;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"dependency cycles and unused primitive methods;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"relations between features, when "},{"t":"code","text":"--feature-glob"},{"t":"text","text":" names the feature with a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":":name"},{"t":"text","text":" capture;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the violations of the rules "},{"t":"code","text":"assertArchitecture"},{"t":"text","text":" enforces, grouped by rule;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"coverage per route, when a coverage report is applied with "},{"t":"code","text":"--coverage"},{"t":"text","text":";"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"documentation per kind, when JSDoc or Markdown pages were collected."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every section is sorted and every id is relative to the root, so two reports of"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the same code are identical whatever the checkout path. Commit the Markdown file"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"if you want architecture changes to show up in review."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The same data is available in code:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { formatGraphReportMarkdown, graphReport } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/dev-tools/graph-report'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { architectureViolations } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/dev-tools/architecture-graph'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"report"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"graphReport","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph, { featureGlob: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'src/features/:feature/**'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"violations"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"architectureViolations","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// [{ rule, messages }]","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"coverage-per-node-and-per-route","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Coverage per node and per route"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The graph reads test coverage; it does not produce it. Write an Istanbul report"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"with Vitest, then hand it to the graph:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"vitest","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--coverage","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--coverage.reporter=json","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"graph","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--project","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"apps/shop/tsconfig.graph.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--root","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":".","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--format","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"all","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--coverage","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"coverage/coverage-final.json","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"shell","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Each statement is credited to the innermost node whose lines contain it, and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the node gets "},{"t":"code","text":"metrics.coverage = { statements, covered }"},{"t":"text","text":" for its own"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"statements. A route's coverage sums the nodes of its code slice — everything"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"that can change what it renders — without counting a statement twice."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Coverage is never guessed:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"a node without a line range, or in a file the report does not mention, has"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"no "},{"t":"code","text":"coverage"},{"t":"text","text":" field. "},{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_GRAPH_COVERAGE_UNKNOWN"},{"t":"text","text":" diagnostics count them per"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"kind;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"a route lists how many nodes of its slice are unknown next to its percentage,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"which only describes the measured part."}]}]]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { applyCoverage, routeCoverage } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/dev-tools/graph-coverage'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"covered"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"applyCoverage","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"JSON","kind":"function"},{"text":".","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"parse","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"readFileSync","kind":"function"},{"text":"(reportPath, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'utf8'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":")));","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"routeCoverage","kind":"function"},{"text":"(covered); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// [{ label, statements, covered, unknownNodes, … }]","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"documentation","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Documentation"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Each node carries a "},{"t":"code","text":"doc"},{"t":"text","text":" field when its declaration has something to say:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"/**","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":" * Loads and caches the signed-in user.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":" * ","kind":"comment"},{"text":"@remarks","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" Shared by every page.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":" */","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"injectUserService"},{"text":" } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftService","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"/* … */","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// WHY: the session expires silently, so reload on focus.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"user"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"query","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"/* … */","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"summary"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"tags"},{"t":"text","text":" come from the JSDoc of the declaration, or of the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"statement around it ("},{"t":"code","text":"export const x = query(…)"},{"t":"text","text":")."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"rationale"},{"t":"text","text":" collects the "},{"t":"code","text":"// WHY:"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"// NOTE:"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"// HACK:"},{"t":"text","text":" comments, each"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"credited to the innermost node that contains it: the comment above "},{"t":"code","text":"user"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"belongs to the query, not to the service."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Markdown pages join the graph through an opt-in collector, from the CLI with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"--docs 'docs/**/*.md'"},{"t":"text","text":" (repeatable) or in code with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"createMarkdownDocsCollector({ include })"},{"t":"text","text":". Each page becomes a "},{"t":"code","text":"doc-page"},{"t":"text","text":" node"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"labelled by its first heading. A page "},{"t":"code","text":"documents"},{"t":"text","text":" a node when it cites the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"node's label in inline code — "},{"t":"code","text":"`UserService`"},{"t":"text","text":" — and that label names exactly"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"one route, component, service or primitive. A label shared by several nodes"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"produces a "},{"t":"code","text":"markdown-docs/CRAFT_GRAPH_DOC_AMBIGUOUS"},{"t":"text","text":" diagnostic and no relation."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Fenced code blocks are ignored."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"See "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture#documentation-rules","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Documentation rules"}]},{"t":"text","text":" to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"require them."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"thresholds","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Thresholds"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Metrics become rules with "},{"t":"code","text":"assertMetricThresholds"},{"t":"text","text":", opt-in and scoped by kind."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"See "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture/metric-thresholds","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Metric thresholds"}]},{"t":"text","text":" for"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"before-and-after examples."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"explorer","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Explorer"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft graph --format html"},{"t":"text","text":" (or "},{"t":"code","text":"all"},{"t":"text","text":") writes a self-contained explorer. On top"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"of the route view it shows:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"in the details panel, the node's metrics, coverage, JSDoc, justification"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"comments and the pages that document it — unknown values read \"inconnu\","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"never "},{"t":"code","text":"0"},{"t":"text","text":";"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"a heat map selector (complexity, fan-in, coverage) that colours the node"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"cards, with a striped pattern for unknown values;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"\"path from\" and \"path to\" buttons that highlight the shortest chain of"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"relations between two nodes, following their direction;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the ten hotspots in the sidebar, and their count next to the uncovered nodes"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"in the header."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"agents","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Agents"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/graph-mcp"},{"t":"text","text":" exposes the graph, the metrics, the report and the impact"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"of a change to an AI agent working in your project. See"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/ai/mcp-tools#graph-mcp-craft-ts-graph-mcp","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"MCP tools"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"metrics","text":"Metrics"},{"level":3,"id":"unknown-is-not-zero","text":"Unknown is not zero"},{"level":2,"id":"hotspots","text":"God nodes and hotspots"},{"level":2,"id":"report","text":"Report"},{"level":2,"id":"coverage-per-node-and-per-route","text":"Coverage per node and per route"},{"level":2,"id":"documentation","text":"Documentation"},{"level":2,"id":"thresholds","text":"Thresholds"},{"level":2,"id":"explorer","text":"Explorer"},{"level":2,"id":"agents","text":"Agents"}]}